title: KPO — money, milestones and credit

@kpo_payment_dossier_2024
# prose-audit: Grade A — The action plan is correctly separated from a transfer, and all five routes now end in authored consequence: an open ledger nobody wanted to sign, a raid on a common fund defended as such, a fortnight's speed bought at the cost of a signature, and two opposition instruments honest about their own thinness.
title: The KPO payment dossier
subtitle: An action plan is not yet a transfer.
