@article7_shared_scoreboard
title: Publish one coalition scoreboard and one unresolved-courts annex
subtitle: Share the European win while keeping unfinished courts on the record.
view-if: left_in_government = 1 and kpo_article7_reward = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.kpo_public_credit += 2;
Q.kpo_delivery += 2;
Q.public_trust += 4;
Q.ko_relation += 3;
Q.psl_relation += 2;
Q.government_coalition_dissent -= 3;
Q.kpo_last_credit_change = 2;
Q.kpo_last_delivery_change = 2;
Q.kpo_last_summary = "Shared credit buys calm while the annex prevents a false claim of legal completion.";
Q.news_headline = "The coalition separates KPO delivery from unfinished court repair";
!}

Every governing party gets a column and the annex gets its own page: the
courts, the prosecutors and the appointments that European closure did not
touch. The coalition can celebrate together as long as it also admits together
what remains unrepaired.

KO would have preferred the celebration without the annex. PSL would have
preferred neither. The document survives because refusing to sign it would have
been the only newsworthy thing about the week.

- @kpo_result: Publish the scoreboard

@article7_left_delivery
title: Claim the reward through wages, care and public investment
subtitle: Give normalisation a social price tag and invite partners to contest our claim.
view-if: left_in_government = 1 and kpo_article7_reward = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.kpo_public_credit += 6;
Q.kpo_delivery += 3;
Q.labor_credibility += 4;
Q.public_sector_support += 3;
Q.ko_relation -= 4;
Q.psl_relation -= 2;
Q.government_coalition_dissent += 3;
Q.kpo_last_credit_change = 6;
Q.kpo_last_delivery_change = 3;
Q.kpo_last_summary = "A clear Left claim travels, and coalition partners immediately contest it.";
Q.news_headline = "Lewica gives European normalisation a social price tag";
!}

We refuse to let normalisation be a diplomatic abstraction and put a number
beside it: what restored access is worth in wages, care places and public
investment, and which of those we intend to collect first.

The claim travels because it is concrete. It is contested within the hour, by
partners who spent two years on the legal file and do not intend to watch the
Left convert their work into a social invoice.

- @kpo_result: Attach the price tag

@article7_pm_credit
title: Let [+ prime_minister +] bank the European win for later coalition concessions
subtitle: Centralise the win around the serving prime minister and accept who gains the leverage.
view-if: left_in_government = 1 and kpo_article7_reward = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.kpo_delivery += 1;
if (Q.government_party == "lewica") {
    Q.kpo_public_credit += 4;
    Q.government_delivery += 2;
    Q.party_unity += 2;
    Q.razem_dissent -= 1;
    Q.ko_coalition_dissent += 2;
    Q.psl_coalition_dissent += 1;
    Q.kpo_last_credit_change = 4;
    Q.kpo_last_summary =
        "The cabinet gains stability, and Lewica's prime minister owns the European win.";
} else {
    Q.kpo_public_credit -= 4;
    if (Q.government_party == "ko") {
        Q.ko_relation += 7;
        Q.ko_coalition_dissent -= 4;
    } else if (Q.government_party == "psl") {
        Q.psl_relation += 7;
        Q.psl_coalition_dissent -= 4;
    } else if (Q.government_party == "p2050") {
        Q.p2050_relation += 7;
        Q.p2050_coalition_dissent -= 4;
    } else {
        Q.government_coalition_dissent -= 4;
    }
    Q.razem_dissent += 5;
    Q.progressives_dissent += 3;
    Q.kpo_last_credit_change = -4;
    Q.kpo_last_summary =
        "The cabinet gains stability; the Left disappears behind " +
        Q.prime_minister + ".";
}
Q.kpo_last_delivery_change = 1;
Q.news_headline =
    Q.prime_minister + " owns the return to Europe's first rank";
!}

The win is banked centrally. **[+ prime_minister +]** takes it to Brussels,
takes it to the cameras and — more importantly — takes it into the next
coalition negotiation, where a leader who has just restored Poland's European
standing is a leader who is owed something.

Whoever holds the Chancellery now holds that credit. If it is not us, we have
strengthened the hand that will be used against our own demands in December.

- @kpo_result: Bank the European win

@article7_opposition_truth
title: Welcome the money and list every unresolved domestic institution
subtitle: Welcome the money without certifying every domestic institution as repaired.
view-if: left_in_government = 0 and kpo_article7_reward = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.kpo_public_credit += 3;
Q.public_trust += 2;
Q.media_capacity += 2;
Q.ko_relation -= 2;
Q.pis_relation -= 1;
Q.kpo_last_credit_change = 3;
Q.kpo_last_delivery_change = 0;
Q.kpo_last_summary = "The opposition accepts the European reward without certifying the government's legal record.";
Q.news_headline = "The Left welcomes KPO money and keeps the court ledger open";
!}

We welcome the money without pretending it certifies anything. Article 7 closed
because the political conflict changed, not because a Polish court was repaired,
and the list of what remains unrepaired goes out beside our welcome.

It is a harder position to hold than either applause or denunciation. Judges'
associations recognise it immediately; the government finds an opposition it
cannot accuse of wanting Poland to fail.

- @kpo_result: Welcome it honestly

@article7_pis_conditions
title: Publish every unmet benchmark and the statutes needed to clear it
subtitle: Show the route out of the impasse without pretending Europe has approved it.
view-if: government_party = "pis" and left_in_government = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.kpo_scrutiny += 4;
Q.media_capacity += 2;
Q.judicial_repair_mandate += 3;
Q.pis_relation -= 4;
Q.kpo_last_credit_change = 0;
Q.kpo_last_delivery_change = 0;
Q.kpo_last_funds_change = 0;
Q.kpo_last_summary =
    "Lewica publishes a route out of the impasse without claiming a payment or completed milestone.";
Q.news_headline =
    "Lewica lists the conditions still blocking Article 7 and KPO";
!}

We set out exactly what closure would require: the statutes, the appointments
and the disciplinary rules, each with the article number that would have to
change. It is a route map for a government that has no intention of walking it.

The point is not to persuade the cabinet. It is to ensure that when the money
stays frozen, nobody in the country can honestly claim the conditions were
secret or impossible.

- @kpo_result: Publish the benchmarks

@article7_pis_pressure
title: Make the frozen file a competence case against the PiS cabinet
subtitle: Turn the frozen file into a competence case against PiS, not fictional progress.
view-if: government_party = "pis" and left_in_government = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.media_capacity += 3;
Q.labor_credibility += 2;
Q.pis_relation -= 6;
Q.ko_relation -= 1;
Q.kpo_last_credit_change = 0;
Q.kpo_last_delivery_change = 0;
Q.kpo_last_funds_change = 0;
Q.kpo_last_summary =
    "The opposition turns the frozen file into accountability, not fictional European progress.";
Q.news_headline =
    "Lewica blames the surviving PiS cabinet for the frozen recovery file";
!}

We stop arguing about sovereignty and start arguing about arithmetic: the
billions not drawn down, the projects not started, the counties that watched
Czech and Slovak neighbours build things. The file is frozen because ministers
chose a fight, and the bill arrives in places that did not.

PiS is comfortable defending a constitutional principle and much less
comfortable defending a road that was never built. Konfederacja notices the
opening and starts making the same argument without the social half.

- @kpo_result: Make it a competence case


@kpo_budget_gate_2024
