    0,
    Q.kpo_funds_available - Q.kpo_funds_spent
);
const kpoBudgetReadiness24 =
    Q.kpo_milestones * 2 + Q.kpo_delivery -
    Q.kpo_deadline_pressure - Q.kpo_shortcut_debt * 2;
Q.kpo_review_2024 =
    kpoBudgetReadiness24 >= 15
        ? "Milestones credible"
        : (kpoBudgetReadiness24 >= 4
            ? "Corrective file required"
            : "Next tranche at risk");
Q.kpo_last_credit_change = 0;
Q.kpo_last_delivery_change = 0;
Q.kpo_last_funds_change = 0;
Q.kpo_last_summary = "The first full coalition budget must distinguish grants, co-financing and ordinary promises.";
Q.news_headline = "KPO co-financing enters the first full coalition budget";
!}

= December 2024 — Projects must be ready before grants support the budget

Review: **[+ kpo_review_2024 +]**. Tranches released but not yet committed:
**[+ kpo_uncommitted +]**.

The coalition can convert ready projects into budget capacity, repair a weak
file, or count milestones on paper and move the risk into 2025.

- @budget_gate_social
- @budget_gate_correction
- @budget_gate_paper
- @budget_gate_opposition

@budget_gate_social
title: Match KPO money with the housing, care and local-service budget
subtitle: Spends two released tranches matching ready social projects into the budget.
view-if: left_in_government = 1
choose-if: kpo_uncommitted >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Too little unlocked money remains for a matched package.
on-arrival: {!
Q.kpo_funds_spent += 2;
Q.budget += 2;
Q.kpo_delivery += 5;
Q.kpo_public_credit += 4;
Q.government_delivery += 4;
Q.fiscal_stress = Math.max(0, Q.fiscal_stress - 2);
Q.psl_relation += 2;
Q.razem_dissent -= 3;
Q.kpo_last_credit_change = 4;
Q.kpo_last_delivery_change = 5;
Q.kpo_last_summary = "Ready European projects add real room to the governing budget.";
Q.news_headline = "KPO co-financing protects the coalition's social investment";
!}

Ready European projects go into the domestic budget as matched lines, which
means housing, care and local services enter December with something no other
demand has: a co-financing partner and a start date.

The Finance Ministry accepts them because refusing free European money is
difficult to explain. Our own negotiators note that the projects we could match
were the ones already prepared — the counties with no project office are still
waiting for a first one.

- @kpo_result: Match the money

@budget_gate_correction
title: Fund a transparent correction team before promising the tranche
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Repair a weak file before promising money that has not moved.
view-if: left_in_government = 1
choose-if: resources >= 1
