!}

Money is taken from schemes that cannot finish and given to municipal and
social projects that can. Every reallocation has a minister on the losing end,
and several of them are ours.

The counties that gain are the ones with a shovel-ready file and a project
officer who answers the telephone. The review will record more completions.
Two ministries will record that Lewica raided their budgets to get them.

- @kpo_result: Move the money

@midterm_correction
title: Sign a coalition correction protocol with measurable deadlines
subtitle: Trade an easy headline for a dated coalition repair plan.
view-if: left_in_government = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.kpo_milestones += 3;
Q.kpo_delivery += 3;
Q.kpo_deadline_pressure = Math.max(0, Q.kpo_deadline_pressure - 4);
