Q.news_headline = "The coalition signs a dated KPO correction protocol";
!}

The coalition signs a repair plan with dates against each item rather than
announcing a rescue. It is deliberately boring, and the dates are deliberately
close enough that missing one will be noticed.

There is no ribbon to cut this month. What there is, for the first time in the
programme, is a document against which every partner can be held in public —
including us.

- @kpo_result: Sign the protocol

@midterm_brand
